WEBVTT

00:09:58.957 --> 00:10:02.322
According to a 2015 study

00:10:02.346 --> 00:10:06.102
that was published
in the Oxford Economic Papers,

00:10:06.596 --> 00:10:10.072
when industrial growth increases by 1%,

00:10:10.826 --> 00:10:14.193
domestic terrorism decreases by 1%.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:17.171
So what does that mean?

00:10:18.433 --> 00:10:23.458
When communities gain access
to the global economy through trade,

00:10:23.482 --> 00:10:25.838
they reap so many benefits.

00:10:27.297 --> 00:10:29.875
I stand here and ask you
one last question: